 *
 * Refactored into 5 distinct interaction model state machines:
 * 1. handleSingleClick  â single-point tools (horizontal_line, vertical_line,
 *                         annotations, icons) â one click commits the drawing
 * 2. handleTwoClick     â two-point tools (trend_line, ray_line, rectangle,
 *                         fibonacci, gann, shapes, positions, etc.) â two clicks
 * 3. handleMultiPoint   â multi-point tools (pitchfork, patterns, triangle_shape,
 *                         parallelogram, disjoint_angle) â N clicks, with Enter/
 *                         double-click early completion
 * 4. handleDrag         â drag-based tools (range_tool, date_range, price_range,
 *                         measure, rectangle, ellipse, circle, rounded_rectangle)
 *                         â mousedown â mousemove (live preview) â mouseup commit
 * 5. handleFreehand     â freehand brush tools (brush, highlighter, scribble)
 *                         â mousedown â mousemove (throttled 16ms sampling) â
