 *                         parallelogram, disjoint_angle) â N clicks, with Enter/
 *                         double-click early completion
 * 4. handleDrag         â drag-based tools (range_tool, date_range, price_range,
 *                         measure, rectangle, ellipse, circle, rounded_rectangle)
